the associated vendor partner. Visit Career Services for more information or with any questions. View Open Positions for Students Equal Opportunity Employer Equal Opportunity/Non-Discrimination: St. Ambrose University is an equal opportunity employment employer, and is in compliance with all applicable state, federal and local laws. St. Ambrose University administers its employment on a non-discriminatory basis, with regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, age, marital status, physical or mental handicap, disability, military status, or any other unlawful basis. St. Ambrose University complies with the Jeanne Clery Act by compiling an annual security report. This report is available to all prospective students and employees here . A paper copy may be obtained by sending a request to: security@sau.edu OSHA English Polygraph - English FMLA English FMLA - Spanish USERRA Federal Minimum Wage EEO English EEO - Spanish IA State Minimum Wage IA Workforce Unemployment Insurance Notice to Employees Hiring Software Maintained by isolved Talent Acquisition - © 2026 1330 Elmhurst Dr. NE, Cedar Rapids, IA 52402 | 319-363-1323 Contact Us Request Info Visit Apply Give News & Events Campus Map Careers Directory Privacy ©2026  Mount Mercy University facebook twitter linkedin youtube instagram tiktok Nondiscrimination Statement: Mount Mercy is committed to providing opportunity to people regardless of economic or social status and will not consider race, color, creed, religion, national origin, ethnic origin, sex, sexual orientation, disability, gender identity, age, marital status, citizenship, genetic testing, veteran's/military status, pregnancy or related medical conditions, other medical conditions, or any other factor protected by law unrelated to ability in admission or access to, or treatment or employment in, its programs and activities. Learn more ."
